025-10-10T22:05:35.317-07:00\",\"body\":\"we use category to group actions, please make it more user friendly\",\"resolved\":false,\"resolvable\":true,\"type\":\"DiffNote\",\"file\":\"app/actions/engagement_letter_template/base.rb\",\"line\":9,\"line_type\":\"new\"},{\"id\":59111,\"discussion_id\":\"e4cd79a9e0f8e8b092d230127d437abc722933d7\",\"author\":\"david\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-10T22:05:35.550-07:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-10-10T22:05:35.550-07:00\",\"body\":\"no need true, since destroy! explodes or returns true\",\"resolved\":false,\"resolvable\":true,\"type\":\"DiffNote\",\"file\":\"app/actions/engagement_letter_template/destroy.rb\",\"line\":53,\"line_type\":\"new\"},{\"id\":59112,\"discussion_id\":\"a903b1987ecf6480d42d46157da026d23aa28f1d\",\"author\":\"david\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-10T22:05:35.710-07:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-10-10T22:05:35.710-07:00\",\"body\":\"since we have almost all the catches for Active record errors, we should `update!`\",\"resolved\":false,\"resolvable\":true,\"type\":\"DiffNote\",\"file\":\"app/actions/engagement_letter_template/update.rb\",\"line\":49,\"line_type\":\"new\"},{\"id\":59113,\"discussion_id\":\"6ac05f8c966f356f9296fe5dfd9c3b3e037ed832\",\"author\":\"david\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-10T22:05:35.868-07:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-10-10T22:05:35.868-07:00\",\"body\":\"no need since base already does this\",\"resolved\":false,\"resolvable\":true,\"type\":\"DiffNote\",\"file\":\"app/actions/public/engagement_letter/base.rb\",\"line\":36,\"line_type\":\"new\"},{\"id\":59114,\"discussion_id\":\"8baf150e1bf1171f174fcd473d1d69bd8532d9db\",\"author\":\"david\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-10T22:05:35.993-07:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-10-10T22:05:35.993-07:00\",\"body\":\"if default value is `true` no need to implement this function\",\"resolved\":false,\"resolvable\":true,\"type\":\"DiffNote\",\"file\":\"app/actions/public/engagement_letter/base.rb\",\"line\":12,\"line_type\":\"new\"},{\"id\":59115,\"discussion_id\":\"e5